                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jinu Joy Thomas",
                        "email": "jinu.joy.thomas@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "jinuthomas"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes ideally doxygen documentation specifies to write it in a readable form. And since this has been followed , would be better if we can have a new line in between. Could you please add one"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/event_logger.hpp",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SunnySrivastava",
                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "I don\u2019t see this being followed across the repository, also because if we take our coding guidelines as base, it does not mandate blank line between param and return. Whereas mandates between other fields.\n\nSo this change would require change in our guidelines document and other part of the code as well."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/event_logger.hpp",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
